@startuml Sprint 6 Implemented Flow - Contract-Aware Webhook
!theme plain
title <font size=24 color="#2E7D32"><b>SPRINT 6 IMPLEMENTED: Contract-Aware Webhook Flow</b></font>\n<font size=14 color="#388E3C">WebhookProcessingService now uses WebhookContractFulfillmentHandler</font>

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor<<stripe>> #E3F2FD
    BackgroundColor<<new>> #C8E6C9
    BackgroundColor<<contract>> #FFF9C4
    BackgroundColor<<event>> #E1BEE7
    BackgroundColor<<db>> #F3E5F5
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #C8E6C9
    BorderColor #2E7D32
    FontColor #000000
}

box "External" #ECEFF1
    participant "Stripe" as Stripe <<stripe>>
end box

box "Webhook Layer" #E8F5E9
    participant "WebhookController" as WC
    participant "WebhookProcessingService" as WPS
    participant "WebhookContractFulfillmentHandler" as WCFH <<new>>
end box

box "Contract Layer" #FFF9C4
    participant "ContractRepositoryInterface" as CR <<contract>>
    participant "PaymentContract" as PC <<contract>>
end box

box "Event System" #F3E5F5
    participant "EventDispatcher" as ED <<event>>
    participant "ContractFulfilledEvent" as CFE <<event>>
end box

box "Database" #F3E5F5
    database "osc_payment_contract" as DBContract <<db>>
    database "oxorder" as DBOrder <<db>>
end box

== Sprint 6: Contract-Aware Webhook Processing ==

Stripe -> WC : POST /webhook/stripe\nEvent: payment_intent.succeeded\nPI: pi_xxx
activate WC #90CAF9

WC -> WC : Verify signature
WC -> WPS : processEvent(event)
activate WPS #A5D6A7

note right of WPS #C8E6C9
  **NEW: Contract-aware path first**
  Tries handler before legacy fallback
end note

WPS -> WCFH : handlePaymentSucceeded("pi_xxx")
activate WCFH #81C784

note right of WCFH #C8E6C9
  **Step 1: Find contract by providerOrderId**
end note

WCFH -> CR : findByProviderOrderId("pi_xxx")
activate CR #FFF59D
CR -> DBContract : SELECT * WHERE provider_order_id = 'pi_xxx'
DBContract --> CR : contract_data
CR --> WCFH : PaymentContract (state=COMMITTED)
deactivate CR

note right of WCFH #C8E6C9
  **Step 2: Idempotency check**
  Skip if already FULFILLED
end note

WCFH -> PC : getState()
PC --> WCFH : ContractState::COMMITTED

alt Contract already FULFILLED
    note right of WCFH #FFF9C4
      return false (idempotent)
    end note
    WCFH --> WPS : false
else Contract is COMMITTED (expected)
    note right of WCFH #C8E6C9
      **Step 3: State transition**
    end note

    WCFH -> PC : fulfill()
    activate PC #FFF59D
    PC -> PC : setState(FULFILLED)\nsetFulfilledAt(now)
    PC --> WCFH : void
    deactivate PC

    note right of WCFH #C8E6C9
      **Step 4: Persist state**
    end note

    WCFH -> CR : save(contract)
    activate CR #FFF59D
    CR -> DBContract : UPDATE state='FULFILLED', fulfilled_at=NOW()
    CR --> WCFH : void
    deactivate CR

    note right of WCFH #C8E6C9
      **Step 5: Dispatch event**
    end note

    WCFH -> ED : dispatch(ContractFulfilledEvent)
    activate ED #CE93D8
    create CFE
    ED -> CFE : new(contract, context, orderId)
    ED --> WCFH : void
    deactivate ED

    WCFH --> WPS : true (fulfilled)
end
deactivate WCFH

note right of WPS #C8E6C9
  **Backward compatibility:**
  Still update oxorder fields
end note

WPS -> DBOrder : UPDATE OXPAID=NOW(), OXTRANSSTATUS='OK'

WPS --> WC : processed
deactivate WPS

WC --> Stripe : 200 OK
deactivate WC

legend right
  |= Step |= Component |= Action |
  | 1 | ContractRepository | findByProviderOrderId("pi_xxx") |
  | 2 | PaymentContract | getState() - check idempotency |
  | 3 | PaymentContract | fulfill() - transition state |
  | 4 | ContractRepository | save() - persist to DB |
  | 5 | EventDispatcher | dispatch(ContractFulfilledEvent) |

  **CONTRACT STATE TRANSITION:**
  COMMITTED → FULFILLED

  <font color="#2E7D32"><b>SPRINT 6 FIX COMPLETE!</b></font>
  Contract layer no longer bypassed.
  State machine integrity preserved.
endlegend

footer <font color="#2E7D32"><b>Sprint 6: Contract-aware webhook processing - IMPLEMENTED 2024-12-04</b></font>

@enduml
